      "ref": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-bem.txt",
      "text": "Nomba, eyapa UKULONGANA KWAFYALO FYONSE kwasosa, Ifyasosele ifyalo fyonse palwa nsambu sha muntu nge cilingile ukufikilishiwa ku muntu naku fyalo fyonse, pakuti cila muntu ne ncende yonse mu calo aikala, ukulaibukisha ifi fyasoswa lyonse, nokwesha ukulafunda nokusambilila mu kutwala pantanshi ukucindika ishi nsambu bo buntungwa, elyo mukubomfya inshila shalinga, ifyalo nafyo ukumona ukuti ifi fyaishibikwa nokukonkwa isonde lyonse, ku bantu baba mu fyalo fyaba bumembala ukubikapo nefyalo fitungululwa kuli bambi."
     }
    ],
